# Pairs with NoPhantomAudit. Whether a removal changed anything is taken from
# the read the call made before its commit (the authorization read) rather
# than from the store's merge, so of two concurrent removals of one entry both
# report a change and both are recorded as committed.
MODULE: AuditChangedFromStaleRead
TARGET: NoPhantomAudit
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a removal's change is taken from a read made before the commit
PERTURBS: Commit

--- FIND
!.landed = lands, !.changed = lands,
--- REPLACE
!.landed = lands, !.changed = r \in {"ok", "infra"} /\ (op[o].kind = "put" \/ op[o].base # 0),
--- END
